│  installs no verification callback, and gates the protected resource on      │
│  handshake completion; the client loads no certificate: `./poc               │
│  server_cert.pem server_key.pem - - established`. The empty certificate      │
│  list is accepted (`client_certificates=0`), no server-side callback runs,   │
│  and the client reads `TOP-SECRET-DATA` (`granted=1`).                       │
│  4. Scenario B — same server, additionally gating on `tls_client_verified()  │
